NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses across the Vale of Glamorgan — from Penarth and Barry to Cowbridge, Llantwit Major, and beyond. Every logo is designed by hand, with no AI tools and no off-the-shelf templates.

## Why professional branding matters in the Vale

The Vale of Glamorgan has a strong community of independent businesses, professionals, and tradespeople — and in that market, how you present yourself matters. A professionally designed logo signals that you're credible and established. It makes every other piece of marketing — your website, your signage, your social media — look more polished and more trustworthy.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts covering different directions
- Revisions until you're completely satisfied
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/).

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is drawn in Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icon libraries. Your logo is unique to your business.

## Pair it with your website

We design and build websites alongside new brand identities, so everything is consistent from day one. See our [web design service](/services/web-design/).

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Contact us for a fixed-price quote with no hidden costs.

**How long does it take?**

Most projects are completed within 5–10 working days.

**Will I own the logo?**

Yes — full ownership transfers to you on completion.

**Do you work across the Vale of Glamorgan?**

Yes — we work with businesses across the Vale, including Barry, [Penarth](/logo-design-penarth/), Cowbridge, and Llantwit Major. We also offer [ecommerce web design for Vale businesses](/ecommerce-web-design-vale-of-glamorgan/) and [local SEO in the Vale of Glamorgan](/seo-vale-of-glamorgan/).

